==Battleground==
*1 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark Cats]] can deal with this stage pretty easily. Be cautious, as [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI &amp; Maji Cat &amp; Cat]] has <b>300,000 Health</b>.

